  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " provides some primitives that do not have a direct correspondence in the \
Wolfram language."
}], "Text",
 CellID->737323585, ExpressionUUID->"bb67e889-2930-4fab-87b1-e664e3fc7343"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Visualize a disk that has it's center at {0,0,1} and a plane with a normal  \
in direction {0,-1,0}, a radius of 1/2 and an arc length from \[Pi] to 2 \
\[Pi].\
\>", "MathCaption",
 CellID->939096682, ExpressionUUID->"4c7ba8f5-d728-4d2e-86b5-b56185eed24c"],

