 "Create a OpenCascadeCircle primitive in ",
 StyleBox["OpenCascade",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "."
}], "MathCaption",
 CellID->420321881, ExpressionUUID->"85843cd5-e263-4389-9126-f715dc572f5b"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
