Cell["\<\
A shell is a collection of faces. To create a solid either an option can be \
used during the sewing process or the function OpenCascadeShapeSolid can be \
used.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1667064307, ExpressionUUID->"f889311b-f7e6-4c2f-8a2a-86adfe10fdf5"],

